          "description": [
            "A local pairwise aligner\u00a0that has full sensitivity, i.e. guarantees to report all matches of a given minimal length and maximal error rate. The aligner is composed of two steps, filtering and verification. For filtering it applies the SWIFT algorithm, for which we have developed a new, exact verification strategy."
