          "description": [
            "Gustaf is a tool primarily designed for multi-split mapping of sequencing reads.",
            "RazerS 3 - Faster, fully sensitive read mapping.",
            "MicroRazerS - Rapid Alignment of Small RNA Reads.",
            "An open source C++ library of efficient algorithms and data structures for the analysis of sequences with the focus on biological data. Our library applies a unique generic design that guarantees high performance, generality, extensibility, and integration with other libraries. The library is easy to use and simplifies the development of new software tools with a minimal loss of performance. Additionally, it includes several ready-made command line tools for common tasks in sequence analysis.",
            "RazerS 3 is a tool for mapping millions of short genomic reads onto a\nreference genome. It was designed with focus on mapping next-generation\nsequencing reads onto whole DNA genomes. RazerS 3 searches for matches of\nreads with a percent identity above a given threshold (-i X), whereby it\ndetects alignments with mismatches as well as gaps.",
            "SeqAn's official repository.",
            "Mason is a collection of tools for the simulation of biological sequences.",
            "Yara is an exact tool for aligning DNA sequencing reads to reference genomes.",
            "Seqan is a C++ template library of efficient data structures and algorithms for sequence analysis.",
            "A fast, feature-rich and hackable read simulator for the simulation of NGS and Sanger data.",
            "Design and off-target prediction for antisense oligomers targeting bacterial mRNAs with the MASON web server.",
            "SeqAn::T-Coffee - Multiple Sequence Alignment.",
            "STELLAR is a tool for finding pairwise local alignments between long genomic or very many short sequences.",
            "Code and analysis for MASON paper.",
            "This tool allows one to cut sequences and parts of sequences out of sequence files.",
            "SeqAn is an open source C++ library of efficient algorithms and data structures for the analysis of sequences with the focus on biological data."
          ],
